# Earnings transcript + audio

Replicate **Quartr’s approach**, not Quartr’s archive: capture issuer-published audio/transcripts with Finsepa tooling and keep our own files for product + future data sales.

- Prefer company IR / Podcasts / YouTube / Q4 webcasts over Stock Analysis or Quartr embeds.
- Aggregators are bootstrap only when the issuer window already closed.
- Apple (AAPL): official audio lasts ~2 weeks — use `scripts/aapl-capture-earnings-audio.ts` inside that window; do not scrape Quartr for “first-party.”
- Full policy: `docs/earnings-transcript-audio.md`
